<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
</head>

<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f6f9;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">

<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f4f6f9;padding:40px 15px;">

<tr>
<td align="center">

<table width="700" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#ffffff;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.08);">

<tr>
<td style="background:#0d6efd;color:#fff;padding:25px;text-align:center;">

<h1 style="margin:0;font-size:28px;">
⏰ Momak ERP
</h1>

<p style="margin-top:10px;font-size:16px;">
Task Reminder
</p>

</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td style="padding:35px;">

<p style="font-size:17px;">
Hello <strong><%= @username.titleize %></strong>,
</p>

<p style="font-size:16px;color:#555;line-height:1.7;">
This is a reminder that one of your assigned tasks is approaching its deadline.
Please review the details below and complete it before the due time.
</p>

<table width="100%" cellpadding="12" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid #e5e5e5;margin-top:25px;">

<tr style="background:#f8f9fa;">
<td width="180"><strong>Task</strong></td>
<td><%= @task.title %></td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td><strong>Description</strong></td>
<td><%= @task.description.presence || "No description provided." %></td>
</tr>

<tr style="background:#f8f9fa;">
<td><strong>Due Date</strong></td>
<td>
<%= @task.due_date.strftime("%A, %d %B %Y") %>
</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td><strong>Due Time</strong></td>
<td>
<%= @task.due_date.strftime("%I:%M %p") %>
</td>
</tr>

<tr style="background:#f8f9fa;">
<td><strong>Status</strong></td>
<td>
<%= @task.status.to_s.titleize.presence || "Pending" %>
</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td><strong>Recurring</strong></td>
<td>
<%=
if @task.daily?
  "Daily"
elsif @task.weekly?
  "Weekly"
elsif @task.monthly?
  "Monthly"
else
  "One Time"
end
%>
</td>
</tr>

</table>

<div style="text-align:center;margin-top:35px;">

<a href="https://momakerp.com/tasks"
style="
display:inline-block;
padding:15px 35px;
background:#198754;
color:#ffffff;
text-decoration:none;
font-size:17px;
font-weight:bold;
border-radius:8px;">
Open Momak ERP
</a>

</div>

<div style="margin-top:35px;padding:18px;background:#fff8e6;border-left:5px solid #ffc107;border-radius:6px;">

<strong>Reminder</strong><br>

Completing tasks on time improves planning, accountability, and overall team productivity.

</div>

<p style="margin-top:35px;color:#666;">
Thank you for using
<strong>Momak ERP</strong>.
</p>

</td>
</tr>

<tr>

<td style="background:#f8f9fa;padding:20px;text-align:center;font-size:13px;color:#777;">

<strong>Momak ERP</strong><br>

Business Management System

<br><br>

🌐 https://momakerp.com

</td>

</tr>

</table>

</td>
</tr>

</table>

</body>
</html>